    {
      "id": "9dcc89f0-d371-4eaf-91c8-714581bfeeb1",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        640,
        144
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 544,
        "height": 416,
        "content": "## Request Submission\nEmployee submits approval request via form (Purchase Order/Document/Internal). Captures type, title, amount, department, justification, requester name/email.Normalizes form data for downstream processing. (trigger \u2192 data prep)"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "d0312989-6b39-41a2-a0b5-3730ece4820a",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1232,
        144
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 736,
        "height": 416,
        "content": "##  AI Risk Analysis\nGPT-4o-mini analyzes request: generates summary, risk score (1-10), priority, suggested approver level. Extracts JSON from markdown response. Prepares AI insights + form data for routing decision.(3 nodes, analysis \u2192 parsing \u2192 merging)"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "68d0bebe-ee00-4728-9408-1e82357c8749",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2000,
        144
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1008,
        "height": 416,
        "content": "##  Route, Store and Notify Approver\nRoutes each request to Manager, Finance Head, or Director using amount and risk level. Saves the full request with AI insights in Supabase, builds approve and reject links, then emails the selected approver with request details and one click action buttons."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "3dc8efb1-0b65-45d2-b1d6-b399e0dcdd7a",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        640,
        608
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1024,
        "height": 544,
        "content": "##   Approval Decision and Reload\n\nWebhook receives the approve or reject click, then branches by decision. Updates Supabase status with approver action, timestamp, and audit note. Reloads the full request record so downstream notification has complete requester details. "
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "84265dd2-1544-497c-a5dd-45d0115c31f3",
      "name": "Sticky Note4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1744,
        608
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 784,
        "height": 544,
        "content": "##   Notify Requester\n\nReloads the updated request from Supabase, validates requester email exists, then sends outcome notification: Approved with next steps or Rejected with comment. Closes the loop with the original submitter.(3 nodes per branch, reload \u2192 validate \u2192 notify)"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "5e2ce174-be12-4e8c-b226-c19b0c833783",
      "name": "Extract AI JSON Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        1600,
        336
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Get the output text from the AI node\nconst aiOutput = $input.first().json.output[0].content[0].text;\n\n// Remove markdown formatting if present\nconst cleanJson = aiOutput.replace(/```json/g, '').replace(/```/g, '').trim();\n\n// Parse into an object\nconst parsed = JSON.parse(cleanJson);\n\n// Return it as an object\nreturn [{ json: { AI_response: parsed } }];"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "e2efd2e6-f18a-4a96-833e-8a25ed774dc7",
