        "width": 848,
        "height": 1008,
        "content": "\n# AI Multi-Level Approval Workflow\n## How it works:\nThis workflow handles approval requests through a complete cycle from submission to final notification. Employees submit requests via web form which triggers AI analysis using GPT-4o-mini to score risk and assign priority. The system stores complete request details in Supabase including AI insights then automatically routes to the correct approver based on amount thresholds and risk levels. Approvers receive professional emails with one-click approve reject links. Webhook captures decisions branches the flow updates database status with full audit trail and notifies original requester with clear outcome details whether approved or rejected.\n## Setup Steps:\n1. Form Submission\nSubmit approval request through generated web form\n2. Data Processing\nNormalize form fields and prepare for AI analysis\n3. AI Risk Analysis\nGPT-4o-mini generates risk score priority and summary\n4. Approver Routing\nRoute by Approval Level selects Manager Finance Head or Director\n5. Database Storage\nCreate complete request record in Supabase table\n6. Approver Notification\nEmail correct approver Manager Finance Head or Director with action links\n7. Decision Capture\nWebhook receives approve or reject click from approver\n8. Status Update\nUpdate Supabase record with decision timestamp and audit details\n9. Reload Request\nReload Approved or Rejected Request for full notification data\n10. Requester Notification\nEmail original submitter with approved or rejected outcome."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
